WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.377 --> 00:00:03.527
Unit twenty-one. Sugar and Snacks!

2
00:00:04.477 --> 00:00:08.237
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.287 --> 00:00:11.653
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.703 --> 00:00:15.518
Today we learn about Sugar and Snacks. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.541 --> 00:00:19.774
Sugar. Say it with me. Sugar!

6
00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:26.723
Snack. Say it with me. Snack!

7
00:00:30.223 --> 00:00:33.690
Soda. Say it with me. Soda!

8
00:00:37.192 --> 00:00:40.625
Label. Say it with me. Label!

9
00:00:44.123 --> 00:00:47.090
Fruit. Say it with me. Fruit!

10
00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:53.640
Teeth. Say it with me. Teeth!

11
00:00:57.143 --> 00:01:00.727
Energy. Say it with me. Energy!

12
00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:07.613
Choice. Say it with me. Choice!

13
00:01:11.122 --> 00:01:20.594
Many snacks and sodas have a lot of sugar. Too much sugar is bad for my teeth and gives only quick energy. I can read the label and make a healthy choice like fruit.

14
00:01:20.644 --> 00:01:21.816
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.135 --> 00:01:28.317
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.367 --> 00:01:29.517
Soda!

17
00:01:30.355 --> 00:01:35.619
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.669 --> 00:01:36.819
Energy!

19
00:01:37.722 --> 00:01:43.739
Did you know? One can of soda can have more sugar than a child should eat in a whole day!

20
00:01:43.789 --> 00:01:45.788
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:46.519 --> 00:01:54.321
Think and answer. What healthy snack could replace a soda?

22
00:01:54.371 --> 00:01:55.521
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.642 --> 00:02:01.274
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.324 --> 00:02:03.912
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

